      "description": "DATA SCIENCE INTERN Company: Talent to Job Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Salary: Performance-Based, up to ₹30,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Talent to Job Tech is a technology-driven company focused on data science, artificial intelligence, and innovative digital solutions...",
      "raw_description": "DATA SCIENCE INTERN Company: Talent to Job Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Salary: Performance-Based, up to ₹30,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY Talent to Job Tech is a technology-driven company focused on data science, artificial intelligence, and innovative digital solutions. The company uses advanced analytical approaches to solve business challenges and support smarter decision-making. ABOUT THE ROLE Talent to Job is looking for an analytical and curious Data Scientist to extract meaningful insights from complex datasets and develop data-driven solutions. The selected candidate will work on statistical analysis, machine learning, data visualization, and predictive modeling to support business objectives. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES Collect, clean, and preprocess datasets. Perform exploratory data analysis to identify trends and patterns. Develop and evaluate statistical and machine learning models. Apply data science techniques to solve business problems. Create visualizations and dashboards to present insights. Optimize models for accuracy and performance. Prepare analytical reports and project documentation. Collaborate with teams on data-driven projects. Research emerging data science tools and technologies. ELIGIBILITY Bachelor's degree in Data Science, Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, or a related field. Freshers and experienced candidates are welcome. Strong understanding of data analysis and statistical concepts. Interest in machine learning and predictive analytics. Ability to solve analytical and technical problems. REQUIRED SKILLS Python programming. Knowledge of Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn. Understanding of statistics and probability. Familiarity with machine learning algorithms. Knowledge of data visualization techniques. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Good communication and teamwork abilities. PERKS & BENEFITS Performance-based salary up to ₹30,000/-. Opportunity to work on real-world data science projects. Professional development and career growth. Exposure to modern analytical tools and technologies. Collaborative work environment. Recognition for outstanding contributions. EQUAL OPPORTUNITY Talent to Job is committed to providing an inclusive and supportive workplace. We welcome candidates from diverse backgrounds who are passionate about data science, technology, and innovation.",
