      "description": "📢 WE'RE HIRING | IT PROJECT COORDINATOR – CLIENT DELIVERY & TEAM OPERATIONS Company: W3MG Software and Internet Services Pvt. Ltd. Location: Fully Remote - Work from Home Experience: 1–3 Years Employment Type: Full-time / Part-time (depending on availability) W3MG is looking for ...",
      "raw_description": "📢 WE'RE HIRING | IT PROJECT COORDINATOR – CLIENT DELIVERY & TEAM OPERATIONS Company: W3MG Software and Internet Services Pvt. Ltd. Location: Fully Remote - Work from Home Experience: 1–3 Years Employment Type: Full-time / Part-time (depending on availability) W3MG is looking for a proactive and well-organized IT Project Coordinator to join our team and help manage day-to-day project coordination, team progress tracking and client communication. If you have a good understanding of software development processes, excellent communication skills and the ability to keep things moving, we'd love to hear from you! 🚀 Key Responsibilities: Coordinate with developers and track daily task progress. Collect daily updates and monitor project milestones. Follow up on pending tasks, deadlines and development blockers. Act as a coordination point between the development team and international clients. Handle routine client communication and project status updates. Participate in client meetings, prepare meeting notes and track action items. Maintain project documentation and update tools like Jira, Trello or similar platforms. Prepare daily and weekly project status reports. Identify potential delays and escalate critical issues to management. 🎯 Requirements: 1–3 years of experience in IT Project Coordination, Project Management or a similar role. Basic understanding of the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). Familiarity with web development, frontend, backend, APIs and QA processes. Good written and verbal English communication skills. Experience with Jira, Trello, ClickUp or similar project management tools. Strong organizational, follow-up and multitasking abilities. Comfortable communicating with international clients. ⭐ Good to Have: Previous experience working with international clients. Technical education (BCA, MCA, B.Tech or equivalent). Experience coordinating remote development teams. What We Are Looking For We need someone who takes ownership, follows up proactively, communicates confidently and ensures that nothing slips through the cracks. You should be comfortable coordinating with developers, communicating with clients and keeping projects organized without constant supervision. 📩 Interested? Apply directly through LinkedIn. Do not email or contact via Phone. Know someone who would be a great fit? Tag them or share this post! #Hiring #WeAreHiring #ITJobs #ProjectCoordinator #ITProjectManagement #SoftwareDevelopment #TechJobs #ClientCommunication #W3MG",
