      "raw_description": "Data Science Intern Company: Jobs4PanIndia Location: Remote (Pan India) Duration: 3 Months Stipend: Up to ₹10,000 (Performance-Based) Internship Type: Paid, Remote Internship Eligibility: Students | Freshers | Graduates | Working Professionals | Career Switchers About the Opportunity Interested in Data Science, Machine Learning, or turning data into meaningful insights? Here's an opportunity to develop your skills! Jobs4PanIndia is inviting applications for its Data Science Internship Program , designed for individuals interested in gaining practical experience in data analysis, statistical modeling, machine learning, predictive analytics, and data-driven problem-solving. Whether you're a college student, fresher, self-taught learner, working professional, or someone transitioning into Data Science, this opportunity is open to applicants across India. No prior professional experience is required. Your analytical skills, interest in working with data, and willingness to learn matter. What You'll Do Collect, clean, process, and analyze structured and unstructured datasets. Perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to identify patterns, trends, and relationships. Work with Python and data science libraries such as Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn. Assist in building, training, testing, and evaluating machine learning models. Apply statistical methods and predictive analytics to practical problems. Create charts, visualizations, and reports to communicate insights. Assist with feature engineering, data preparation, and model performance evaluation. Collaborate remotely on assigned data science projects and analytical tasks. Who Can Apply? College students from any academic background. Freshers and recent graduates interested in Data Science. Working professionals looking to expand their analytical and technical skills. Career switchers exploring opportunities in Data Science and Machine Learning. Self-taught learners and individuals interested in data-driven technologies. Candidates with foundational programming or data analysis knowledge. Applicants from all educational backgrounds are welcome. A Data Science-specific degree or previous industry experience is not mandatory. Skills We're Looking For Basic understanding of Python, data analysis, or related concepts. Familiarity with mathematics, statistics, or logical problem-solving. Interest in machine learning, predictive analytics, and data interpretation. Strong analytical thinking and attention to detail. Willingness to learn new technologies and work on practical projects. Ability to work independently and complete assigned tasks remotely. Knowledge of SQL, Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Power BI, Tableau, TensorFlow, or other data science tools is an advantage, not mandatory. Why Apply? 100% remote internship opportunity. Gain practical exposure to Data Science and Machine Learning. Work on data analysis, predictive modeling, and statistical projects. Develop technical skills in Python, data preprocessing, and model evaluation. Strengthen analytical thinking and data-driven problem-solving abilities. Performance-based stipend of up to ₹10,000, subject to applicable eligibility and evaluation criteria. Open to students, freshers, graduates, working professionals, and career switchers across India. Ready to Start Your Data Science Journey? Data Science plays an important role in helping organizations understand information, identify opportunities, and make informed decisions. Whether you're exploring Data Science for the first time or looking to strengthen your existing technical expertise, Jobs4PanIndia welcomes motivated individuals who are interested in learning, analyzing, and building data-driven solutions. Applications Open – Students, Freshers, Graduates, Working Professionals & Career Switchers Are Welcome! Apply Now – Build Your Future in Data Science with Jobs4PanIndia!",
