      "raw_description": "Artificial Intelligence Intern Company: Jobs4PanIndia Location: Remote (Pan India) Duration: 3 Months Stipend: Up to ₹10,000 (Performance-Based) Internship Type: Paid, Remote Internship (Performance-Based) Eligibility: Students | Freshers | Graduates | Working Professionals | Career Switchers About the Opportunity Passionate about Artificial Intelligence? Turn your interest in AI into practical experience! Jobs4PanIndia is inviting applications for its Artificial Intelligence Internship Program , designed for individuals interested in exploring Machine Learning, Generative AI, Deep Learning, AI-powered applications, and emerging intelligent technologies. Whether you're a student exploring AI, a fresher entering the technology industry, a self-taught enthusiast, a working professional upgrading your skills, or someone transitioning into Artificial Intelligence, this opportunity is open to applicants across India. No prior professional experience is required. Your curiosity, foundational technical skills, problem-solving abilities, and willingness to learn matter. What You'll Do Develop and explore AI-powered applications and intelligent solutions. Work with Python and popular AI/ML libraries. Assist in data preprocessing, model training, testing, and evaluation. Explore Generative AI, Large Language Models (LLMs), and prompt engineering. Work on machine learning algorithms and predictive models. Assist in building AI chatbots, automation tools, and intelligent applications. Research emerging AI technologies and identify practical use cases. Collaborate remotely on assigned AI projects and development tasks. Who Can Apply? College students from any academic background. Freshers and recent graduates interested in AI. Working professionals looking to develop AI-related skills. Career switchers exploring opportunities in Artificial Intelligence. Self-taught programmers and AI enthusiasts. Individuals with foundational programming knowledge and an interest in AI technologies. Applicants from all educational backgrounds are welcome. An AI-specific degree is not mandatory. Skills We're Looking For Basic understanding of Python or another programming language. Familiarity with Artificial Intelligence or Machine Learning concepts. Strong logical thinking, analytical ability, and problem-solving skills. Interest in AI tools, automation, and emerging technologies. Willingness to learn, collaborate, and complete assigned tasks. Additional knowledge of NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Generative AI, LLMs, LangChain, RAG, or Deep Learning is an advantage, not mandatory. Why Apply? 100% remote internship opportunity. Practical exposure to Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning. Opportunity to explore Generative AI and modern AI technologies. Develop programming, analytical, and AI problem-solving skills. Gain experience through assigned AI development projects. Performance-based stipend of up to ₹10,000, subject to applicable eligibility and evaluation criteria. Open to applicants with different educational and professional backgrounds. Ready to Explore Your Future in AI? Artificial Intelligence is transforming industries, and developing practical AI skills can open doors to new career opportunities. Whether you're taking your first step into AI or expanding your existing technical expertise, Jobs4PanIndia welcomes motivated individuals who want to learn, build, and grow in Artificial Intelligence. Applications Open – Students, Freshers, Graduates, Working Professionals & Career Switchers Are Welcome! Apply Now – Start Your Artificial Intelligence Journey with Jobs4PanIndia!",
