      "description": "Business Analyst Intern Company: Thinknovaa Duration: 3 Months Work Mode: Remote Stipend: Up to ₹10,000 (Performance-Based) About the Internship Thinknovaa is looking for enthusiastic individuals interested in Business Analysis. This internship offers an opportunity to gain pract...",
      "raw_description": "Business Analyst Intern Company: Thinknovaa Duration: 3 Months Work Mode: Remote Stipend: Up to ₹10,000 (Performance-Based) About the Internship Thinknovaa is looking for enthusiastic individuals interested in Business Analysis. This internship offers an opportunity to gain practical experience in business research, data analysis, requirement gathering, process improvement, and strategic decision-making through hands-on projects. Responsibilities Assist in analyzing business processes, operational workflows, and organizational requirements. Collect, organize, and analyze business data to identify trends, patterns, and improvement opportunities. Gather, document, and evaluate business requirements for assigned projects. Prepare business reports, dashboards, presentations, and analytical insights. Work with Microsoft Excel, SQL, Power BI, or similar business analytics tools. Assist in creating Business Requirement Documents (BRD), Functional Requirement Documents (FRD), and process flow diagrams. Conduct market research, competitor analysis, and business performance evaluations. Support KPI tracking, performance monitoring, and data-driven decision-making. Collaborate with team members on assigned business analysis and process optimization projects. Requirements Basic understanding of business analysis concepts and business processes. Familiarity with Microsoft Excel or Google Sheets. Knowledge of SQL, Power BI, Tableau, or Python is an advantage. Basic understanding of data analysis, requirement gathering, and business documentation is beneficial. Familiarity with Agile methodologies, Jira, or business process mapping is a plus. Interest in business strategy, market research, process optimization, and data-driven decision-making. Strong analytical thinking, problem-solving skills, and attention to detail. Good communication, documentation, and interpersonal skills. Ability to work independently in a remote environment. Willingness to learn new business analysis tools and techniques. Who Can Apply? Students, freshers, graduates, working professionals, and career switchers interested in Business Analysis are welcome to apply. Prior professional experience is not mandatory. Join Thinknovaa to strengthen your business analysis skills, work on practical business projects, develop analytical and problem-solving abilities, and gain valuable experience in business operations, requirement analysis, and strategic decision-making. This is a paid, remote internship with a duration of 3 months and a performance-based stipend of up to ₹10,000.",
