      "description": "Job Title : Business Analyst Intern Company: Medinex Workforce Location: India Workplace Type: Remote Employment Type: Full-time internship Duration: 1 to 3 months Stipend: Up to INR 14,000 per month About the Role Medinex Workforce is looking for analytical and detail-oriented B...",
      "raw_description": "Job Title : Business Analyst Intern Company: Medinex Workforce Location: India Workplace Type: Remote Employment Type: Full-time internship Duration: 1 to 3 months Stipend: Up to INR 14,000 per month About the Role Medinex Workforce is looking for analytical and detail-oriented Business Analyst Interns who are interested in understanding business requirements, analysing information, and supporting data-driven decision-making. Interns will gain practical exposure to business analysis, reporting, documentation, and problem-solving while working alongside the team on business-related assignments. What You’ll Do * Collect and analyse business data to identify trends and performance patterns. * Prepare reports and summaries using Microsoft Excel. * Assist in gathering, understanding, and documenting business requirements. * Support the preparation of business presentations and analytical reports. * Use SQL to retrieve and organise information from databases. * Identify operational challenges and suggest possible improvements. * Assist in preparing process documentation, workflows, and requirement summaries. * Collaborate with team members to understand project objectives and deliverables. * Support the team in tracking project progress and business performance metrics. Who Can Apply * Students and recent graduates from BBA, B.Com, B.A, B.Sc, BCA, B.Tech, MBA, or related fields. * Candidates with basic knowledge of Microsoft Excel and data analysis. * Individuals interested in business operations, research, and strategic analysis. * Candidates with good communication and problem-solving abilities. * Basic knowledge of SQL, Power BI, or business reporting is an added advantage. Key Skills * Business Analysis * Microsoft Excel * SQL * Data Analysis * Business Research * Requirement Gathering * Business Reporting * Power BI * Data Interpretation * Process Documentation * Problem Solving * Analytical Thinking * Microsoft PowerPoint * Communication Skills * Critical Thinking What You’ll Gain * Hands-on experience in business analysis and reporting. * Practical exposure to business data and operational workflows. * Experience in requirement gathering and documentation. * Understanding of business performance analysis and reporting techniques. * Development of analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills. * Professional guidance and internship completion certificate. Applicant Privacy Practices Medinex Workforce collects and processes applicant information solely for recruitment, internship selection, and related communication. Your information may be reviewed by authorised members of the Medinex Workforce team for evaluating your application and contacting you regarding the opportunity. We do not sell applicant information to third parties. Applicant information is handled securely and retained only for as long as reasonably necessary, subject to applicable laws and regulations. Equal Opportunity Employer Medinex Workforce is an equal opportunity organisation. We are committed to providing a fair and inclusive environment and do not discriminate against applicants based on gender, age, disability, religion, race, caste, nationality, or any other protected characteristic. Selection is based on qualifications, skills, experience, and suitability for the role.",
